# nexora-action-code: get_bgp_routes
# Comware V5's global table command is ``display bgp routing-table``.
Value Required FLAGS ([*><^dehisS?\s]+)
Value Required NETWORK ((?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}(?:/\d+)?|[0-9a-fA-F:]+/\d+)
Value Required NEXT_HOP ((?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}|[0-9a-fA-F:]+)
Value ATTRIBUTES (.+)

Start
  ^\s*${FLAGS}\s+${NETWORK}\s+${NEXT_HOP}\s+${ATTRIBUTES}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$
